  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-02-23T17:58:33.438Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This is a feature that would fix the issues addressed in:\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/more-parameters-unity\nIt would do this while still keeping the parameters 128 bytes.\nA bool actually only uses the first bit of a byte, wasting 7 bits of space (Thats 7 entire toggles!)\nIf you do something called bit-packing then you can put 8 bools into a byte.\nThis would mean that you can have a total of...\n8 * 128 == 1024\n1024 Toggles in the parameter menu!!!\nWith this you wouldn't need to resize the parameters.\nIts free real estate ;)",
